			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — README formatting and void element self-closing\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to d135b7e7, incorporating a Maintain submodule update from e641fa3d to edd9fc68. That update reformats README files with tab indentation for table rows and headings and adds self-closing slashes to void <img> and <source> elements throughout the funding acknowledgment table.\n\nAll changes are purely presentational README formatting adjustments with no functional behavior changes.",
