				146,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule and add Python requirements\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to 929baf025, incorporating two formatting-only commits: one expands the Element root README table blocks into indented multi-line markup, and another normalizes README HTML formatting across all Element submodule README trees with consistent tab indentation, self-closing void elements, and explicit <br /> line breaks. These are presentational adjustments with no functional or rendered-output changes.\n\nAdd requirements.txt at the Land root to document minimum Python version (3.10+), required system tools (dos2unix, shfmt, rustup, pnpm, lychee, Xcode CLT), and the Node.js/pnpm toolchain versions needed for editor development and maintenance scripts.",
			"SHA": "5470b3e42b9ec2ccee84ff8f9c0a58b431ddff07"
		},
